  "Notes": "Multiplex filter Ag-L-2Ag-L-Ag (calculated)\nSpecification: Single pass band at 546 nm\nReported: Fig. 14(a): half-width 5.1 deg phi; peak transmittance 45 % (text p. 239).\nLayers from Fig. 14 caption and text p. 238 ((h/lambda)_Ag = 0.0641); layer 1 faces the incident medium.\nChecked with ThinFilmDesigner (2026-10-21), differs from the paper: ours peak T 41.3 % at 531 nm; paper peak T 45 % (constant Ag index). Not exactly reproducible: the paper plots against the dielectric phase thickness with the silver held fixed, which a calculation against wavelength does not do (T at 546 nm, phase 90 deg: 26 %).",
